  "prefLabel": "Plc 301.06 Incorporated Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 301.06 Incorporated Definitions. All terms used in these rules relative to procedures, applications, inspections, and fees that are defined in Plc 100, Plc 200, Plc 400, or Plc 1000 shall have the meaning specified in those chapters.\n\nSource. #14137, eff 12-1-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc300.html"
